[ti:After the Dark]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:31.64]I came after the dark
[00:33.38]With the dark still on me
[00:35.38]Not like a weight
[00:37.02]More like electricity
[00:38.62]Old stone in the speakers
[00:41.34]New light in the floor
[00:43.26]A bell somewhere broken
[00:45.38]Still asking for more
[00:47.38]The room kept flashing
[00:48.60]Like a memory glitch
[00:50.08]Half holy
[00:51.02]Half switch
[00:51.50]I was not going backwards
[00:52.74]I was not getting free
[00:54.14]I was learning what the shadow
[00:55.56]Had become in me
[00:56.64]After the dark
[00:57.96]The body still moves
[01:02.82]After the dark
[01:06.08]The light feels new
[01:10.80]Not clean
[01:12.42]Not ruined
[01:13.48]Not saved
[01:14.72]Not lost
[01:16.64]Just alive
[01:17.74]With a beautiful cost
[01:26.02]There was joy in the wrong place
[01:30.44]A smile in the wire
[01:31.52]A sweet little melody
[01:32.58]Walking through fire
[01:33.54]The organs were breathing
[01:34.68]Like machines in a dream
[01:35.78]And the beat made the old world
[01:37.00]Lean into the screen
[01:37.82]I heard something ancient
[01:38.80]Under polished glass
[01:39.80]Not asking to stay
[01:40.86]Not willing to pass
[01:41.88]A ritual in neon
[01:42.96]A prayer in the bass
[01:43.92]A future with a gothic
[01:45.18]Aftertaste
[01:46.24]Lux in motu
[01:47.82]Forma vivit
[01:50.08]Then the room came back
[01:51.56]But it came back strange
[01:52.74]Same pulse
[01:53.56]New frame
[01:54.12]Same dark
[01:54.60]New name
[01:55.30]Some things don’t leave us
[01:56.26]The way people say
[01:57.20]They enter the rhythm
[01:58.22]They alter the day
[01:59.26]They make the present
[02:00.24]A little less clean
[02:01.32]More alive
[02:02.54]More seen
[02:03.32]What was night
[02:04.54]Doesn’t vanish in light
[02:05.96]It learns a new colour
[02:07.62]And keeps moving inside
[02:10.90]After the dark
[02:13.22]The body still moves
[02:18.74]After the dark
[02:21.34]The light feels new
[02:26.36]Not clean
[02:27.64]Not ruined
[02:28.72]Not saved
[02:29.88]Not lost
[02:30.88]Just alive
[02:31.82]With a beautiful cost
[02:36.58]After the dark
[02:37.60]I don’t turn back
[02:39.52]I carry the shimmer
[02:41.36]At the edge of the black
[02:45.22]
